WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.259 --> 00:00:15.241
You can really see far from up here.

2
00:00:15.261 --> 00:00:17.662
Tina: Hey, look over there.

3
00:00:17.682 --> 00:00:20.324
It’s my wagon.

4
00:00:20.344 --> 00:00:24.086
Bello: And isn’t that your neighbor, Mrs.

5
00:00:24.186 --> 00:00:27.349
Rice? Tina: I wonder what she is looking for.

6
00:00:27.369 --> 00:00:32.212
Bello: Did you see that!

7
00:00:32.756 --> 00:00:34.677
Tina: It must have been the shrink-gun.

8
00:00:35.318 --> 00:00:36.219
Somebody found it.

9
00:00:36.239 --> 00:00:37.840
Bello: Great!

10
00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:38.940
Let’s go see.

11
00:00:40.081 --> 00:00:45.525
Tina: Follow me.

12
00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:50.409
Danny: Help!

13
00:00:51.209 --> 00:00:54.732
Help! Brad: We’re stuck!

14
00:00:54.752 --> 00:00:57.674
Dave: That sounds like Danny and Brad.

15
00:00:57.694 --> 00:01:00.216
Chuck: It sounds like they’re over here.

16
00:01:07.148 --> 00:01:08.849
Dave: Hey, what happened to you guys?

17
00:01:08.869 --> 00:01:11.431
Danny: What do you think happened?

18
00:01:12.131 --> 00:01:13.352
We got caught in a web.

19
00:01:13.372 --> 00:01:16.654
Chuck: I don’t see a spider anywhere.

20
00:01:16.674 --> 00:01:19.536
Brad: Yes, but we’re still stuck.

21
00:01:20.177 --> 00:01:20.957
Get us out.

22
00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:27.202
This spider web is really sticky.

23
00:01:27.222 --> 00:01:29.043
Dave: I’ve got an idea.

24
00:01:29.763 --> 00:01:31.084
Let’s take off their shoes.

25
00:01:31.765 --> 00:01:34.387
Brad: This is not the time to tease us.

26
00:01:34.407 --> 00:01:36.188
Dave: We’re not.

27
00:01:36.736 --> 00:01:37.857
This is going to help.

28
00:01:43.501 --> 00:01:45.542
Okay, your feet are unstuck.

29
00:01:46.323 --> 00:01:48.044
Dave: See, I told you this would help.

30
00:01:48.064 --> 00:01:49.425
Danny: Now what?

31
00:01:49.445 --> 00:01:51.587
Dave: We pull!

32
00:02:01.594 --> 00:02:02.494
What’s going on?

33
00:02:03.055 --> 00:02:04.356
Were you fighting again?

34
00:02:05.592 --> 00:02:07.254
Brad: No, we weren’t fighting.

35
00:02:07.874 --> 00:02:09.696
We were stuck in a spider web.

36
00:02:09.716 --> 00:02:11.817
Danny: They helped us get free.

37
00:02:12.358 --> 00:02:16.161
Thanks. Chuck: Glad to help.

38
00:02:17.883 --> 00:02:19.344
Bello: We saw a big flash.

39
00:02:20.045 --> 00:02:21.085
Did you find the shrink-gun?

40
00:02:21.125 --> 00:02:23.908
Danny: Yes, but it disappeared.

41
00:02:25.369 --> 00:02:27.051
Dave: Eww, a spider.

42
00:02:27.071 --> 00:02:31.634
Brad: Did you just squish a spider?

43
00:02:32.395 --> 00:02:33.016
Let me see.

44
00:02:34.964 --> 00:02:38.587
Brad: We’re tiny, but that spider is really, really tiny.

45
00:02:38.607 --> 00:02:41.129
Brad: I think I know what happened.

46
00:02:41.149 --> 00:02:45.453
Chuck: Does he always get so excited?

47
00:02:45.473 --> 00:02:48.496
Danny: Only when he has a really smart idea.

48
00:02:48.516 --> 00:02:50.458
Brad: I found it!

49
00:02:51.138 --> 00:02:52.439
Everybody, come here!

50
00:02:52.459 --> 00:02:53.560
I found it!

51
00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:57.764
Tina: It’s the shrink-gun!

52
00:02:57.804 --> 00:02:59.185
Bello: It shrunk!

53
00:02:59.245 --> 00:03:01.988
Brad: Yes, that’s what happened.

54
00:03:02.988 --> 00:03:04.809
The spider was pulling at the nano-putty.

55
00:03:04.849 --> 00:03:09.233
Brad: The shrink-gun fired, and it shrunk the spider and the gun.

56
00:03:10.053 --> 00:03:12.895
Chuck: Great!

57
00:03:13.215 --> 00:03:15.017
We’ll all be back to normal soon.

58
00:03:15.037 --> 00:03:21.662
Brad: I’ll check Oh no Danny: What’s the matter?

59
00:03:21.682 --> 00:03:25.384
Brad: No, it’s not going to work.

60
00:03:25.404 --> 00:03:26.925
Danny: Why not?

61
00:03:26.945 --> 00:03:29.607
Brad: The nano-putty is gone!
